{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1363719-devaro-linnea-a-belated-white-elephant-for-chronos12","id":1363719,"title":"Devaro Linnea - A (Belated) White Elephant for Chronos12","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-27T18:55:16-08:00","id":1363719,"title":"Devaro Linnea - A (Belated) White Elephant for Chronos12","content":"Back during the The Ninth Annual Exalted White Elephant, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar14713_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"14713\" data-vbnamecard=\"14713\">Chronos12</a> produced a lovely <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356860-gaian-fangs-a-white-elephant-for-reighnhell#post1356860\">artifact</a> for me,then included bonus material. Since their original gift-giver did not come through, I made a little something as a thank you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I like Solars, I like kind-hearted Solars more. I'd like to see a Solar taking on one of the majors problems of Creation like Slavery, Hunger, or more straight forward issues like the Deathlords. It's one of my favorite things about all of Exalted, but Solars fit the narrative so well as a new rising force in the world of trying to make the world a better place with the might of their power. </div> </div> </div>Here is <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xbCaPo43fNM1Wl7EjLmRWYQ2SsUckzXJ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Devaro Linnea</a><br /> <br /> Hope you like her!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-27T21:09:35-08:00","id":1363732,"title":"","content":"I can't help but laugh and laugh about how many story beats she shares with my own Solar (A linguistics supernal Eclipse). Those two will make amazing foils to each other and in fact my character as a mortal might have saw the world through her eyes before she exalted! I can't help but imagining their conversations with each other and I can only hope I can fit her into my game now in some way. <br /> <br /> And I say this with as high of praise I can muster, you have not only written all of the info down (In a clear and interesting way), but you honestly took the time to make art for her to. I love characters like this one in RPGs and I always will.<br /> <br /> You have my deepest praise and Gratitude <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar775_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"775\" data-vbnamecard=\"775\">Reighnhell</a> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-29T13:25:39-08:00","id":1364016,"title":"","content":"Glad you like her!<br /> <br /> It was fun doing a full write up with art included. I got to flex a few different skill sets, which is the best kind of challenging.<br /> <br /> If I ever get around to creating the rest of her circle, I will make sure to post them!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\